<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριγμός</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρισμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shrill cry, scream,</i> of the partridge, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριγμὸν ἀφίησι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					614a22
				</span></i>
			; of some fish, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριγμοὺς
			ἀφιᾶσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				535b16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθέγγονται οἷον τρισμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					5.10.5
				</span></i>
			 (but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριγμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>HP</u>
					4.14.5
				</span></i>
			 cod. U); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρισμὸς μυός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a grating, grinding, rasping,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρισμοὶ ὀδόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Acut.(Sp.)</i><i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1520
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρισμοὶ πριόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.654f
				</span></i>
			; <i>crepitation</i> in bone-fractures, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.233
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
